      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Ash]\nAhh, {0}! Welcome to the Official Treasure Hunter's Guild Shop.\nYou currently have ^FF0000{1}^000000 treasure tokens!!!",
      "translation" : "[阿什]\n啊，{0}！欢迎来到官方猎人公会商店。\n您目前拥有^FF0000{1}^000000枚宝物代币！！！"
    },
